WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.686
Some simple PostgreSQL views are automatically
updatable A

00:00:05.713 --> 00:00:11.386
write through the view can flow to the underlying
table But this is not true

00:00:11.399 --> 00:00:17.039
for every view Joins aggregates grouping and other
features can

00:00:17.052 --> 00:00:22.790
make a view non-updatable Treat writable views as a
deliberate interface

00:00:22.817 --> 00:00:24.185
and test their behavior
